seg-a652a4172293 = A Kshana Station is a computer on a site wired to receivers. <c1/> reads each receiver's stream as it arrives and keeps it as <c2/> observation files (<a1>OBS-SCHEMA.md</a1>), reports its state on a local port, and runs unattended as a system service. It only reads: nothing is ever written to a receiver.

