# c2: systemctl enable --now kshana-station
# c3: dialout
seg-f1eeb17ed020 = <b>systemd</b> (Linux): a unit; save it as <c1/>, then <c2/>. It restarts on failure and after a reboot; it is in the <c3/> group for serial ports.

