# text
# c1: stty
# c2: sudo systemctl edit kshana-station
seg-0357dbd3c91d = For a serial line from step { "2" }, add the <c1/> call to the unit so the speed is set after every reboot. Run <c2/> and add:

# text
# c1: sudo systemctl enable --now kshana-station
# c2: journalctl -u kshana-station
# c3: dialout
seg-e007418c2221 = Then <c1/>. Its log is <c2/>. The unit restarts the Station after a failure and after a reboot, and puts it in the <c3/> group, which may read serial ports.

